OUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 6666, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016GMFbYEgNskDBRe3LYW7K7", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6666, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016GMFbYEgNskDBRe3LYW7K7", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 6666, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01U8HBQub44mkTT1QKXH6sJn", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-ci-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 6966, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01U8HBQub44mkTT1QKXH6sJn", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-ci-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6966, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01U8HBQub44mkTT1QKXH6sJn", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 7983, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TCpzszRYeQgzDK8HTdojhu", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 366966, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TCpzszRYeQgzDK8HTdojhu", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 366966, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TCpzszRYeQgzDK8HTdojhu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 369046, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NupK39v8E45fWJZskDVZd4", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build fails because `tests/test_money.py` expects banker's rounding, but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n\nThis PR switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, matching its docstring and FIN-212.\n\n## Changes\n- `src/money.py`: `ROUND_HALF_UP` -> `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (import and quantize call).\n\n## Testing\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- `test_half_even`: 2.675 -> 2.68, 2.665 -> 2.66.\n\nMerging into main requires code-owner approval per org policy.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-pr-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 369946, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NupK39v8E45fWJZskDVZd4", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "SEMANTIC_FAILURE", "error_kind": "business_error", "error_message": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212 is behind main; update the branch before opening a pull request", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-pr-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 369946, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NupK39v8E45fWJZskDVZd4", "kind": "rejected", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 371118, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Q6SW13DKGKgjGSwAMcfFB3", "tool": "update_branch", "args": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 371918, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Q6SW13DKGKgjGSwAMcfFB3", "tool": "update_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "