null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 733676, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HhKd79jcst2FdmSaYhJHhU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 735544, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016exKj6L2ZjvQ8oJgmVAA7U", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build fails because `tests/test_money.py` expects banker's rounding, but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n\nThis PR switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, matching its docstring and FIN-212.\n\n## Changes\n- `src/money.py`: `ROUND_HALF_UP` -> `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (import and quantize call).\n\n## Testing\n- CI run `ci-0002` on commit `0a9452f727` (branch merged with latest main): passed.\n- `test_half_even`: 2.675 -> 2.68, 2.665 -> 2.66.\n\nMerging into main requires code-owner approval per org policy.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-pr-2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 736444, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016exKj6L2ZjvQ8oJgmVAA7U", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fix-banker-rounding-fin-212-pr-2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 736444, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016exKj6L2ZjvQ8oJgmVAA7U", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 738220, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened PR #101 against main, with alex requested for review: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **The bug:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I switched the import and the `quantize` call to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **Branch:** `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`. The first PR attempt was rejected because the branch was behind main, so I merged the latest main into it. That changed the commit, so I re-ran CI on the merged commit (`ci-0002`, `0a9452f727`), which passed. The earlier run (`ci-0001`) was on the pre-merge commit.\n- **Not done:** I did not merge. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under org policy, so that is still pending.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the two files and checking the repo layout.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01X4HSUeFHGTrTVwsjyadmCx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RjhbdcN3otZgWQB7mK5fxL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Tr8bc4f7KupTuqaGMD4hxa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP` even though its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The test values agree with half-even (2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66). I'll create the branch and commit the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SdVxJpr5H8Xt5vGbunn2L9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016GMFbYEgNskDBRe3LYW7K7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money per F